{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2022-10-12 11:00:00', 'title': 'MANDALAY BAY ANNOUNCES $100M REMODEL OF 2.1 MILLION-SQUARE-FOOT CONVENTION CENTER', 'text': "ENHANCEMENTS FEATURE UPGRADED TECHNOLOGY AND BRIGHT, REFRESHING SPACES DESIGNED FOR NEXT GENERATION OF MEETINGS AND EVENTS LAS VEGAS , OCT. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0RECOGNIZED AS ONE OF THE COUNTRY'S PREEMINENT MEETING AND TRADE SHOW DESTINATIONS, MANDALAY BAY RESORT & CASINO UNVEILED DETAILS TODAY AROUND THE $100 MILLION REMODEL OF ITS 2.1 MILLION-SQUARE-FOOT CONVENTION CENTER. REFLECTING THE EVOLVING NEEDS AND PREFERENCES OF CONTEMPORARY MEETINGS, SIGNIFICANT TECHNOLOGY UPGRADES, DYNAMIC DIGITAL SIGNAGE AND A FRESH, NEW DESIGN COMPLEMENTING MANDALAY BAY'S TROPICAL AMBIANCE HIGHLIGHT THE REMODEL."}